The initial architecture shall be:
APPLICATION SERVICES
        ↓
TELEMETRY SDK
        ↓
TELEMETRY COLLECTOR
        ↓
 ┌───────────────┬───────────────┬───────────────┐
 │               │               │
LOG STORAGE   METRIC STORE   TRACE STORAGE
 │               │               │
 └───────────────┴───────────────┘
                 ↓
        OBSERVABILITY PLATFORM
                 ↓
